OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening across the region, with hazy
OL,7,Fsunshine to end the day. Remaining
OL,8,Fgenerally dry overnight but the odd
OL,9,Flight shower, most likely to the west
OL,10,Fof the region, cannot be ruled out.
OL,11,FRather warm light light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FGenerally dry with sunny
OL,14,Fspells, cloud increasing across the
OL,15,Fwest at times turning sunshine hazy
OL,16,Fand with the odd shower possible
OL,17,Fthrough the afternoon. Feeling very
OL,18,Fwarm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
